		{
			dependencies: ["0729C937DEFF1E0B"]
			description: [
				"Immersive Engineering adds its own deep ore veins that can be extracted only by using complex machines. But before that you should find them!"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lMineral Survey Tools&r will help you understand what type of vein exist in the area. Just click on the soil related blocks and with each research you will get more information about veins around."
				""
				"&oHold your rightclick until you get message&r about existing ore vein. To get better understanding of current position of the vein you need to &ogo around the area and collect more samples&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Next step will give you precise data what things exist in the vein and how rich it is."
				""
				"&lCore Sample Drill&r will give you a so called core sample to get vein saturation and exactly what it contains. it needs 40 RF/t to operate, so bring some energy with you!"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"There a diverce amount of deep ore veins in the pack so it is hard to list them here. Look into &oEngineer's manual -> &lMineral Deposits&r &opage&r if you want to see them all."
